        559.886474609375,
        527.0028686523438,
        573.031494140625
      ],
      "text": "The overall sensitivity for rifampicin resistance in these 18 studies ranged from 88% to 100%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.386474609375,
        524.4234008789062,
        588.531494140625
      ],
      "text": "and the specificity from 98% to 100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 96.7% (95% CI: 93.1–",
